Fri Nov 20 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - Caio Bruno <cbrunofb@gmail.com>

- Initial package of spotube 6.0.0: repackage of the upstream official
  x86_64 RPM (Kotlin Compose Multiplatform app bundling a JVM and the
  Skiko runtime) under %{_libdir}/spotube with a wrapper. x86_64 only:
  the project builds no aarch64 repo.

