Fri Nov 20 02:00:00 UTC 2026 - Caio Bruno <cbrunofb@gmail.com>

- Add Requires: vlc: vlcj loads libvlc via JNA/dlopen, so no auto-requires
  is generated and the app crashed on launch (UnsatisfiedLinkError).


-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Nov 20 15:00:00 UTC 2026 - Caio Bruno <cbrunofb@gmail.com>

- Align runtime deps with the upstream .deb Depends (dlopened libs the
  bundle's requires-exclude hides): WebKitGTK (Compose login webview),
  gtk3 (AWT backend), dbus, libXext/libXi/libXrender/libXtst, and
  Recommends libappindicator3-1 for the tray icon.
- Fix the upstream-generic desktop Name/Comment/Categories.


-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Nov 20 16:30:00 UTC 2026 - Caio Bruno <cbrunofb@gmail.com>

- Slim the vlc requirement to the runtime set (libvlc5 + vlc-noX,
  mirroring the upstream .deb libvlc5 + vlc-plugin-base): the full vlc
  pulls the Qt UI and X video outputs the app never uses. vlc-codecs is
  deliberately not required: Packman-only (libavcodec unrestricted) and
  the native libopus/libfaad plugins in vlc-noX already cover YouTube
  Music's opus/aac streams.

